In a doubly-linked list `x->prev` *is* the predecessor:
```c
if (x->prev) x->prev->next = x->next; else head = x->next;
if (x->next) x->next->prev = x->prev;
free(x);
```
A fixed number of pointer updates, whatever $n$ is and wherever `x` is: **DLLdel is $O(1)$**. Together: option **(D)**.
